Explanation :

- equals() compares two students using their registration numbers.
- hashCode() generates a hash value using the registration number.
- HashSet uses hashCode() to locate a bucket and equals() to check whether an equivalent object already exists.
- Duplicate registration numbers are not stored as separate entries.

Time Complexity : 

Operation	        Average complexity
Add student	            O(1)
Search student	        O(1)
Remove student	        O(1)
Iterate students	    O(n)